GRAPH <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_XavierExpert> {
  <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Digest_Actor_XavierExpert> a narr:Digest ;
    narr:digestOf <https://aswritten.ai/narrative#Actor_XavierExpert> ;
    narr:childCount "134"^^xsd:integer ;
    narr:generatedFrom "4a2e5af44505dae82a1f0f0aac97e2348a790a70" ;
    narr:narration """Xavier's own lane runs on [metaphor and analogy layered over stock phrases](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_35), sharpened by [antithesis framing when he pitches a raise](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_199) and reinforced, in a later call, by [anaphora around the same operating thesis](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_12). The portfolio narration runs from [a messy ERP consulting gig](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_37) through [crane-mat project prospecting](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_39), [predicting which quotes bleed margin](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_47), [a personal-graph tool mined from email](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_55), [an edge-AI Slack alternative](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_77), to [a sovereign-AI pilot abroad](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_59). Two theses anchor it: [the sit-in-between moat](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_109), echoed with [formal restatement in the follow-up call](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_13), and [micro SaaS for firms too small for the big consultancies](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_133), priced at [a monthly retainer figure](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_135). He coaches his interlocutor toward [applying to a famous accelerator](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_143), [running a time-bound raise process](narr:Expr_5RealXavierAndTanya60Mins20260720_193), and, in the second call, states it as [a closing decision to stop building and go sell](narr:Expr_6RealAdvisorCall20260728_30).""" ;
